# Everything this repo has MEASURED lives under docs/; calibration/ is source
# only. No rule here covers calibration/ on purpose -- a run that lands next to
# its script should turn git status dirty, because that is the bug.
#
# The bulk of a measurement stays out of git. The small fitted facts do not:
# docs/recoil/weapon_rpm.json, docs/pitch/pitch_range.json,
# docs/compat/kit_facts.json and docs/ballistics/ are each a few hundred bytes
# and are the answer, not the raw data.
docs/recoil/curves/
docs/recoil/curves_legacy/
docs/recoil/runs/
docs/k/
docs/fail/
# Raw telemetry, appended to by every goto(). The CONCLUSION it is for
# (accordion or not) goes into docs/game_quirks.md by hand once
# `pixi run goto-paths` has enough decisive rows to say.
docs/spawner/goto_paths.jsonl
# Same split for every other producer: the run goes, the fitted answer stays.
# docs/spawner/layout.json and docs/regression_baseline.json are NOT here on
# purpose -- both are read back as truth by an offline test, so they are source.
docs/runs/
docs/spawner/runs/
docs/spawner/hover/
docs/tab/runs/
docs/compat/runs/
docs/lobby/runs/
docs/ammo_fire/
docs/impulse/
docs/kick/
docs/gun_grab/
docs/kit_checks/
docs/shots/
docs/.refactor_plan.bak.md

.claude/settings.local.json
# pixi env lives in the repo; the lock file is source, the env is not
.pixi/
training_data/human_detection
training_data/highlight_eval

pico_firmware/.vscode
human_detection/test/
human_detection/*.pt
*.png
# ...except the verification assets. detector/CLAUDE.md names these as the
# reference shots, and docs/regression_baseline.json -- which IS in git --
# scores 5 of its 52 frames against them. The other 47 live under
# docs/spawner/runs/ and stay out as run product, so a fresh clone can only
# reproduce those 5. tools/regression_check.py says so rather than quietly
# grading whatever it happens to find.
# Named one by one, not docs/*.png: that would also drag in the diagnostic
# renders next to them (_right_panel, ocr_template_montage, gun_name_live_masks,
# tab_gun1_row) and tab_full_check.png, which is a composite, not a capture --
# it was once labelled "Tab open" and became the only false negative in the
# tab-open regression. Product, by the same split as everything above.
!docs/tab_inventory.png
!docs/tab_inventory_2.png
!docs/tab_layout.png
!docs/tab_live_aug_vss.png
!docs/training_epuipment.png

docs/ads/runs/

# Ground-truth crops. These are FIXTURES, not run product: `pixi run snaps`
# asserts detector output against them, and a fresh clone that has the sidecar
# but not the image reports "no ground-truth crops on disk" and passes with
# nothing checked. Silent degradation of exactly the kind the labels exist to
# stop, so they are forced back in.
!docs/tab/truth/
!docs/tab/truth/**
